      "id": "lillian-ritochika-douglas",
      "title": {
        "en": "Lillian | Ritochika | Douglas"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Lillian: Best generally\nRitochika: Very very good with Beryl retain as a support, Ritochika passive counts all ally attacks\nDouglas: Easiest to get dupes\nComparison is everyone at Max Dupes"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Westmacott | Scarlet | Priscilla | Asteria | Marianne"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Westmacott: Ego Skill got buffed alot, and just 8% stat stick, never bad\nScarlet: A little bit hard to use, but generally better then Asteria at base\nPriscilla: Easiest to get dupes, and they really aren't that bad\nAsteria: You need dupes to beat the 4 and 3 stars\nMarianne: Still poopoo\n5 stars require dupes to win out over the raw Atk% that 4 and 3 stars give"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
