        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "E1:\nIncreases Lift Anchor Damage Increase, pretty nice\nE2:\nOpens up Moral Support Haru setup, also very good for Chaos/Sortie\nE3:\nIncreases Ego Skill damage, it's ok\nE4:\nVery Tiny Permanent Additive Damage Buff, it's ok\nE5:\nPotential Levels: It's ok\nE6:\nE2's Damage Reudction on Anchor Shot is cut in Half, Very good"
