        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Hand Buff: Very good with Persona Looping Supports to be +50% x 9 = 450%\nDraw Moral: Very minimal damage difference compared to Persona Loop\nDiscard 2: only 120% or 6 Moral, for the cost of -3 Cycle, which is pretty detrimental"
          }
