          "body": {
            "en": "Shot 1: Unga Bunga beats Combo Anchor\nShot 2: 2 Hits is still strong, but requires more knowledge of how to use CE3\nShot 3:Minimal Damage Increase, for 3 AP as well as discard downside\nShot 4: Pretty funny with Pointer 1 + Narja\nShot 5: Conditional 1 extra Anchor Shot, Not iInsanely good, but not terrible\nShot 0 Moral/Vuln are also good options"
